    Bug 2037213 - Fix memory leaks from loading RNP. r=jtracey,kaie


    Without the patch, an ASan build will show these failures e.g. when running

    `./mach test comm/calendar/test/browser/invitations/browser_unsupportedFreq.js`

    ```
    ERROR TEST-UNEXPECTED-FAIL | LeakSanitizer leak at Alloc, nsTSubstring, nsTSubstring, nsTSubstring | automation.py
    ERROR TEST-UNEXPECTED-FAIL | LeakSanitizer leak at Botan::allocate_memory, allocate, allocate, _M_allocate | automation.py
    ERROR TEST-UNEXPECTED-FAIL | LeakSanitizer leak at allocate, allocate, allocate, _M_allocate | automation.py
    ERROR TEST-UNEXPECTED-FAIL | LeakSanitizer leak at make_unique, Botan::AutoSeeded_RNG::AutoSeeded_RNG, make_unique, operator | automation.py
    ERROR TEST-UNEXPECTED-FAIL | LeakSanitizer leak at make_unique, Botan::HashFunction::create, Botan::MessageAuthenticationCode::create, Botan:: | automation.py
    ERROR TEST-UNEXPECTED-FAIL | LeakSanitizer leak at make_unique, Botan::MessageAuthenticationCode::create, Botan::, Botan::AutoSeeded_RNG::AutoSeeded_RNG | automation.py
    ERROR TEST-UNEXPECTED-FAIL | LeakSanitizer leak at make_unique, operator, ffi_guard_thunk, botan_rng_init | automation.py
    ERROR TEST-UNEXPECTED-FAIL | LeakSanitizer leak at operator, ffi_guard_thunk, botan_rng_init, rnp::RNG::RNG | automation.py
    ERROR TEST-UNEXPECTED-FAIL | LeakSanitizer leak at rnp_ffi_create, ffi_call_unix64 | automation.py
    ERROR TEST-UNEXPECTED-FAIL | LeakSanitizer leak at rnp_ffi_st::rnp_ffi_st, rnp_ffi_create, ffi_call_unix64 | automation.py
    ERROR TEST-UNEXPECTED-FAIL | LeakSanitizer leak at wl_egl_window_create, mozilla::widget::WaylandSurface::GetEGLWindow, nsWindow::Create, nsIWidget::Create | automation.py
    ```

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D298743

